 :paras
 ["Its README records the method and the result. Every assistant reply in every Claude Code transcript, 25,505 replies, was counted against my list of avoided words and phrases, read as hits per thousand words by how far into its session the reply came, with sessions that open with the name tag Agent Of Reciprocity kept apart from those that do not.[[r]]"
  "The two curves differ throughout. In the first ten turns, replies without the name tag carried 20.44 avoided words per thousand and replies with it 11.69. By turns 70 to 79 the rates were 35.31 without and 17.08 with. Both rise as a session goes on, and the curve with the name tag stays near half the other.[[r]]"
